<title>FRANCE: Bull names Newey finance director.</title>
<headline>Bull names Newey finance director.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cie des Machines Bull said on Thursday it had appointed Francois Newey to replace Camille de Montalivet as group finance director fron July 1.</p>
<p>De Montalivet will become an executive vice-president and will chair the executive commitee.</p>
<p>Newey, 53, was previously finance director at Pechiney where he left in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
